e art resources.<br><br>Start to play the new version\uff1a<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/937770/extras/1afe0ae1ad504e10515492179713a808.avif?t=1675017282\" /></div><br><br>We will continue to optimize it until it can be officially released\uff01",
